---
import { siteConfig } from '../../../config/site.config';
import Icon from '../../ui/Icon.astro';
---

<section id="contacto" class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="card contact-card reveal">
      <div class="contact-content">
        <span class="contact-eyebrow">
          <Icon name="mail" size={15} />
          <span>Contacto Directo</span>
        </span>
        <h2>¿Tienes un proyecto o vacante en mente?</h2>
        <p>
          Estoy disponible para colaborar en el desarrollo de nuevas aplicaciones web, arquitectura de software o consultoría técnica. Escríbeme y conversemos sobre cómo puedo aportar valor a tu equipo.
        </p>

        <div class="contact-actions">
          <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.email}`} class="btn btn-primary">
            <Icon name="mail" size={18} />
            <span>Enviar Correo</span>
          </a>
          <a href={siteConfig.socials.github} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary">
            <Icon name="github" size={18} />
            <span>GitHub</span>
          </a>
          <a href={siteConfig.socials.linkedin} target="_blank" rel="noreferrer" class="btn btn-secondary">
            <Icon name="linkedin" size={18} />
            <span>LinkedIn</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="contact-box">
        <div class="box-bar">
          <span>contact-info.json</span>
        </div>
        <pre><code>{`{
  "developer": "Alex Rivera",
  "role": "Senior Full-Stack Developer",
  "email": "${siteConfig.email}",
  "status": "Available for new projects",
  "timezone": "UTC-6 / Remote"
}`}</code></pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .contact-card {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1.1fr 0.9fr;
    gap: 2rem;
    align-items: center;
    border-color: rgba(192, 132, 252, 0.35);
    background: linear-gradient(155deg, var(--bg-card) 0%, var(--bg-purple-dark) 100%);
  }

  .contact-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--purple-light);
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 0.65rem;
  }

  .contact-content h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.2rem);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .contact-content p {
    color: var(--text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
  }

  .contact-actions {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .contact-box {
    background: var(--bg-code);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .box-bar {
    background: var(--bg-purple-dark);
    padding: 0.55rem 1rem;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--purple-light);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
  }

  .contact-box pre {
    padding: 1.15rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    color: var(--blue-light);
    overflow-x: auto;
    line-height: 1.65;
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .contact-card {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
